          },
          "description": "This cozy collection of spoken letters offers gentle reassurance, comfort, and love for young children. Each letter meets kids in real moments, when they feel tired, brave, frustrated, unsure, or full of joy, reminding them that all feelings are welcome and that they are deeply loved just as they are. Perfect for bedtime, quiet time, or emotional moments, these letters create a calm, comforting presence children can return to again and again.",
